  },
  "bloques": [
    {
      "tipo": "explicacion",
      "titulo": "Same person, or another",
      "texto": "If you do something for your own aim, use **para** + infinitive.\n\n- Estudio **para aprender**.\n\nIf someone else has to act, use **para que** + present subjunctive.\n\n- Te llamo **para que vengas**.\n- Hablo despacio **para que entiendas**."
